WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
SPEAKER: As customers move
workloads to Google Cloud,

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.160
they need a backup
and disaster recovery

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.670
offering that provides
low RPO and RTO,

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.160
