Google Cloud workloads.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:27.010
Using intelligent data
capture and recovery methods,

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:31.960
Actifio GO provides low RPO and
low RTO for backup and disaster

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.970
recovery use cases.

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:37.660
